<title>NETHERLANDS: HEIDEMIJ Q2 PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>HEIDEMIJ Q2 PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second qtr 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.44 vs   0.44</p>
<p>    Net profit			     8.3  vs   8.1</p>
<p>    Turnover			     292.5  vs 239.7</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.7  vs  11.6</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     1.3  vs   1.0</p>
<p>    Tax					4.2  vs   3.5</p>
<p>    Income from associates	     0.8  vs   2.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Engineering consultancy Heidemij NV previously said</p>
<p>it expected its 1996 net could be roughly in line with 1995's.</p>
</text>
